   "text": "Daniel Holt is a Senior Game Designer at Wizards of the Coast , where he works for Magic: The Gathering since January, 2018.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Originally an Experience Designer, Daniel collaborated with art directors, writers, and concept artists to construct inviting/functional world guides for future Magic sets. He also developed assets to support the games’ many outlets including card frames , set symbols , and merchandise. He provided artistic direction during the card proofing process in terms of crops and foiling , as well as final text approval.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "R&D"
  },
  {
   "text": "In July 2022, he transitioned to full time Game Designer.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "R&D"
  },
  {
   "text": "Additionally, Holt wrote Magic Story recaps for Kamigawa: Neon Dynasty .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "R&D"
